🔎 What this means

When a claim fails validation (example: missing NPI), that error must be logged somewhere.

There should be a table like:

| Encounter ID | Error Code | Error Description | Field |

Example:
| 12345 | ERR_102 | Missing NPI | Billing Provider |

🎯 Why we need it

This allows us to:
